{'symbol': 'GS', 'date': '2022-06-15 10:30:00', 'title': "ALPHASENSE'S VALUATION JUMPS TO $1.7 BILLION WITH $225 MILLION SERIES D LED BY GOLDMAN SACHS ASSET MANAGEMENT AND VIKING GLOBAL", 'text': 'INCREASE IN VALUATION DRIVEN BY STRONG BUSINESS PERFORMANCE AT SIGNIFICANT SCALE, WITH ALPHASENSE MORE THAN DOUBLING ITS USER AND CUSTOMER BASE IN THE PAST YEAR AND SURPASSING $100 MILLION IN RECURRING REVENUE NEW YORK , JUNE 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NEW YORK-BASED\xa0ALPHASENSE, THE LEADING MARKET INTELLIGENCE AND SEARCH PLATFORM, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS $225 MILLION SERIES D FINANCING ROUND LED BY THE GROWTH EQUITY BUSINESS WITHIN GOLDMAN SACHS ASSET MANAGEMENT (GOLDMAN SACHS) AND VIKING GLOBAL INVESTORS. THE FINANCING VALUES THE COMPANY AT $1.7 BILLION, WHICH IS NEARLY DOUBLE THE VALUATION FROM ITS\xa0 $180 MILLION SERIES C FUNDING IN SEPTEMBER 2021 THAT WAS ALSO LED BY GOLDMAN SACHS AND VIKING GLOBAL.'}